{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@preconcurrency"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"compactMap"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"ElementOfResult"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"transform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncSequence\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ElementOfResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA020AsyncThrowingCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaKclF0H8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency31AsyncThrowingCompactMapSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ElementOfResult","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA020AsyncThrowingCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaKclF0H8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"transform","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An error-throwing mapping closure. "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accepts an element of this sequence as its parameter and returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformed value of the same or of a different type. If "},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"throws an error, the sequence ends."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An asynchronous sequence that contains, in order, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"non-","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" elements produced by the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"text":" closure. The sequence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ends either when the base sequence ends or when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"text":" throws an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"text":" method to transform every element received from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a base asynchronous sequence, while also discarding any ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from the closure. Typically, you use this to transform from one type of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element to another.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In this example, an asynchronous sequence called ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Counter"},{"text":" produces ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"values from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5"},{"text":". The closure provided to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"method takes each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"text":" and looks up a corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"text":" from a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"romanNumeralDict"},{"text":" dictionary. Since there is no key for ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"4"},{"text":", the closure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":" in this case, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"text":" omits from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transformed asynchronous sequence. When the value is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5"},{"text":", the closure","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MyError"},{"text":", terminating the sequence.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let romanNumeralDict: [Int: String] =","    [1: \"I\", 2: \"II\", 3: \"III\", 5: \"V\"]","","do {","    let stream = Counter(howHigh: 5)","        .compactMap { (value) throws -> String? in","            if value == 5 {","                throw MyError()","            }","            return romanNumeralDict[value]","        }","    for try await numeral in stream {","        print(numeral, terminator: \" \")","    }","} catch {","    print(\"Error: \\(error)\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"I II III Error: MyError() \""],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates an asynchronous sequence that maps an error-throwing closure over","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the base sequence’s elements, omitting results that don’t return a value."}],"metadata":{"platforms